{"_v":1,"id":"the-holy-rosenbergs-west-end-2026","bd":{"positive":8,"mixed":3,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Times (UK)","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/the-holy-rosenbergs-review-menier-chocolate-factory-l3nc85g2r?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqenumcsm-puoCkN7ehxlC3dcu8bfJAJLoFaQsB4j8iicP5s8r8JmY4e&gaa_ts=69b8a9b3&gaa_sig=yXm2VdC_tjvLJbokmKonJCrdiIAFjS9qqtqV9vZYdKdWyLR1-6BWHTdcIhsOSouHO7J5z4RDneDC1-xIx-Husg%3D%3D"},{"cn":"David Jays","o":"The Guardian","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2026/mar/10/the-holy-rosenbergs-review-jewish-family-menier-chocolate-factory-london-tracy-ann-oberman-ryan-craig","d":"2026-03-10","q":"This absorbing revival of Ryan Craig's play from 2011 is also an unravelling, one in which morality and geopolitics play out."},{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/the-holy-rosenbergs-menier-chocolate-factory-review-b1274198.html","d":"2026-03-10","q":"This is a serious, and at times seriously funny, bid to show how events in Gaza impact Jews elsewhere, but also a clumsy one."},{"cn":"Matt Wolf","o":"London Theatre","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/the-holy-rosenbergs-review-menier-chocolate-factory","d":"2026-03-10","q":"this pressure cooker of a drama is a sharp and timely revival"},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/the-holy-rosenbergs_9607/#:~:text=Ryan%20Craig's%20new%20play,of%20Danny's%20funeral%20in%20Edgware.","d":"2026-03-10","q":"The Holy Rosenbergs is an imperfect play, but a brave and intelligent one too."},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Stage","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/the-holy-rosenbergs-review-menier-chocolate-factory-london","q":"Strong performances hold together this knotty, overstuffed drama"},{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/the-holy-rosenbergs-2-review","d":"2026-03-10","q":"The trouble is that for all its bracing relevance, the Israel/Gaza stuff is so bombastic as to overwhelm the more nuanced family tragedy."},{"cn":"Daz Gale","o":"All That Dazzles  (UK)","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.allthatdazzles.co.uk/post/review-the-holy-rosenbergs-menier-chocolate-factory","d":"2026-03-10","q":"What The Holy Rosenbergs lacks in escapism, it more than makes up for in its thought-provoking nature."},{"cn":"Aleks Sierz","o":"The Arts Desk","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theartsdesk.com/theatre/holy-rosenbergs-menier-chocolate-factory-review-still-timely-and-thought-provoking","q":"The Holy Rosenbergs is a powerful reminder that an excellent piece of new writing is news that stays news."},{"cn":"Greg Stewart","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theatreweekly.com/review-the-holy-rosenbergs-at-the-menier-chocolate-factory/","d":"2026-03-09","q":"This is a strong revival of a play whose resonance has only deepened."},{"cn":"Franco Milazzo","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":71,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/westend/article/Review-THE-HOLY-ROSENBERGS-Menier-Chocolate-Factory-20260309","d":"2026-03-09","q":"The Holy Rosenbergs remains a sturdy, occasionally engaging examination of family, faith and political conscience."}],"au":{"score":75,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":63,"c":4,"sr":3.1},"lb":{"s":100,"c":2,"sr":5}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/1ydBxXa1aSdHGwhvEcOisv/bfa00b882b0f720eacda0a45117ae03b/THR_1440x580---edit.jpg?fm=webp&q=90","pd":"2026-02-27"}